ORIGINAL WORK
-------------
This is an independent implementation of the Infineon TriCore TC1767 (AUDO-F)
native CAN bootstrap-loader flash engine. The target-side loader is original
code, written from our own reverse engineering and the Infineon TC1767
documentation. No third-party source code is included or copied.

SCOPE BOUNDARY
--------------
This engine requires the operator to supply their own chip's flash-unlock key
words. It contains no — and will not accept contributions containing — any
vehicle-specific security-access / seed-key derivation, password (.pwd)
transforms, checksum/CRC-correction math tied to a specific calibration family,
commercial-dongle crypto, or captured calibration/EEPROM data from any target.
Obtaining a chip's keys is out of scope and is the operator's responsibility,
on hardware they own or are authorized to service.

